  "vibe": "A pale ice-blue field (#cfe6ee) carrying deep water-navy (#16344a) Bebas Neue caps, with one flushed-skin coral (#e85c4a) that is held back until it floods the entire CTA frame. The world is a literal dawn swim, drawn not suggested: a white snowbank, a navy hole cut through the ice with broken shards at its rim, two ripple rings pushing outward from a swimmer's head while a breath-cloud rises and fades, a timber sauna at the right whose amber window pulses and whose chimney smoke climbs on a loop, fourteen flakes falling, and a thermometer at the left whose coral column breathes up and down beneath a hand-set '4°'. Cameras drift and rise gently; titles rise, items streak. Built for cold-water clubs, saunas, recovery studios and breathwork apps.",
